<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1470123884190634107 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1470123884190634107><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Sunday, February 8, 2026 10:27 PM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1470123884190634107>2/8/2026 10:27 PM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong><img
